API Endpoints
👤 User Routes
Method	Endpoint	Description
POST	/api/users	Register new user
GET	/api/users	List all users

👥 Group Routes
Method	Endpoint	Description
POST	/api/groups	Create new group
PUT	/api/groups/:id/add	Add user to group

💵 Expense Routes
Method	Endpoint	Description
POST	/api/expenses	Add expense to group
GET	/api/expenses/:groupId	List all expenses in group
GET	/api/settle/:groupId	Calculate net balances

